        "Content": "<ul><li>Seafront home in a highly desirable area</li><li>Full planning permission to expand and upgrade</li><li>Walking distance to Salterstown Pier</li><li>Beautiful views to the rear</li><li>Large, private site with two access points</ul>"
      },
